schedule(dynamic) introduces a huge run-time overhead. It should only be used for loops where each iteration could take a different amount of time and the improved load balancing would justify the overhead. For regular loops like yours dynamic scheduling is an overkill as it introduces unnecessary overhead, which slows down the computation. Change the schedule type to static : #pragma omp parallel for schedule(static) 
for(i=0;i<imgDim;i++)
{
