I am starting with OpenMP and I have to parallelize some C code. I have tried many ways and I have never achieved the desired results. I will show you my parallelization. If you can advise me about how to parallelize it correctly, I will be very grateful. I have got a working (but no perfomanced) parallelized code. I have commented with MAYUS comments where perfomance is lost (I can know where code lost perfomance due to I have tested the code for a long time): #include <File.h>
