I am solving the n Queens problem with OpenMP. (The original eight queens problem consisted of trying to find a way to place eight queens on a chessboard so that no queen would attack any other queen. An alternate way of expressing the problem is to place eight “anythings” on an eight by eight grid such that none of them share a common row, column, or diagonal.) This is the code: #include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
